; Sprite: foot
;
; One 16x16 sprite of 32 bytes: 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel), drawn with
; #R$9456. A foot (toe pointing right). It is frame 2 of sprite page $9C. Drawn at a falling position by the game-over
; sequence #R$8B07 (position from #R$85E4, while the screen flashes), and used as entity sprite by definition $48 in The
; Nightmare Room (room $1D), where it moves up and down.
@label=SpriteFoot
